            <ArticleTitle>Relation between arteriosclerosis in the coronary and renal arteries.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1478-81</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This study analyzes the severity of coronary artery disease in terms of the severity of renal artery disease in 609 patients undergoing coronary and renal angiography. The presence of renal artery disease of any severity is strongly suggestive of advanced coronary artery disease.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
